## Command options

### Install flags
  --claude           Target Claude Code runtime
  --global / -g      Install for all projects (writes to ~/.claude/)
  --local / -l       Install for current project only
  --minimal          Install core 6 commands only (~700 tokens vs ~12k)
  --no-sdk           Skip SDK installation
  --uninstall        Remove GSD from the target location

### Non-interactive installs
  npx get-shit-done-cc@latest --claude --global
  npx get-shit-done-cc@latest --claude --global --minimal
  npx get-shit-done-cc@latest --opencode --global
  npx get-shit-done-cc@latest --gemini --global
  npx get-shit-done-cc@latest --claude --global --uninstall

### Core slash commands
  /gsd-new-project          Initialize project: questions, research, requirements, roadmap
  /gsd-map-codebase         Analyze existing codebase before initialization
  /gsd-discuss-phase N      Capture implementation decisions before planning
  /gsd-plan-phase N         Research, create, and verify atomic task plans
  /gsd-execute-phase N      Run plans in parallel waves with fresh contexts
  /gsd-verify-work N        User acceptance testing with automated diagnostics
  /gsd-ship N               Create PR from verified phase work
  /gsd-next                 Auto-detect next workflow step
  /gsd-quick                Execute ad-hoc tasks without full planning
  /gsd-spike [idea]         Throwaway experiments for feasibility testing
  /gsd-settings             Open settings (or edit .planning/config.json)

### Discuss phase flags
  --batch            Answer grouped questions instead of one-by-one
  --chain            Auto-chain into plan+execute
  --analyze          Add trade-off analysis

### Plan phase flags
  --auto             Skip confirmations
  --reviews          Load codebase review findings
  --skip-research    Omit domain research

### Quick mode flags
  --discuss          Lightweight context gathering
  --research         Investigate approaches before planning
  --full             Enable all phases
  --validate         Plan-checking and verification only

### Config (edit .planning/config.json or run /gsd-settings)
  mode               yolo | interactive
  granularity        coarse | standard | fine
  model profiles:
    quality          Opus for all agents (premium)
    balanced         Opus planning, Sonnet execution (default)
    budget           Sonnet planning/execution, Haiku verification
    inherit          Follow runtime model selection
  workflow.research           Research before planning (default: true)
  workflow.plan_check         Verify plans before execution (default: true)
  workflow.verifier           Confirm deliverables post-execution (default: true)
  workflow.auto_advance       Skip stops between discuss→plan→execute
  workflow.discuss_mode       discuss (interview) | assumptions (codebase-first)

### Output structure (.planning/)
  PROJECT.md         Vision and scope
  REQUIREMENTS.md    v1/v2 requirements
  ROADMAP.md         Phased delivery plan
  STATE.md           Decisions and blockers
  {phase}-PLAN.md    Atomic task definitions
  {phase}-SUMMARY.md Execution results
  research/          Domain analysis
  todos/, threads/, seeds/   Backlog and persistent context
